{"message": [{"role": "user", "content": "다음 코드를 리뷰해줘:\n\n```\n@@ -15,13 +16,11 @@\n def generate_encoders_by_class_tuples(\n     type_encoder_map: Dict[Any, Callable]\n ) -> Dict[Callable, Tuple]:\n-    encoders_by_classes: Dict[Callable, List] = {}\n+    encoders_by_classes: Dict[Callable, List] = defaultdict(list)\n```"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "It won't actually work, because `encoder` should be a key of a dictionary and `type_` should be a tuple of classes.\r\n\r\nBut the main problem that one `encoder` can have multiple `type_` and such case can't be handled using comprehension.\r\n\r\nFor instance result of an original function call will look like:\r\n```python\r\n{\r\n   <cyfunction <lambda> at 0x7ff7f278e5c0>: (<class 'bytes'>,), \r\n   <class 'str'>: (<class 'pydantic.color.Color'>, <class 'ipaddress.IPv4Address'>, <class 'ipaddress.IPv4Interface'>, <class 'ipaddress.IPv4Network'>, <class 'ipaddress.IPv6Address'>, <class 'ipaddress.IPv6Interface'>, <class 'ipaddress.IPv6Network'>, <class 'pathlib.Path'>, <class 'pydantic.types.SecretBytes'>, <class 'pydantic.types.SecretStr'>, <class 'uuid.UUID'>), \r\n   <cyfunction isoformat at 0x7ff7f278e4f8>: (<class 'datetime.date'>, <class 'datetime.datetime'>, <class 'datetime.time'>), \r\n   <cyfunction <lambda> at 0x7ff7f278e688>: (<class 'datetime.timedelta'>,), \r\n   <class 'float'>: (<class 'decimal.Decimal'>,), \r\n   <cyfunction <lambda> at 0x7ff7f278e750>: (<enum 'Enum'>,), \r\n   <class 'list'>: (<class 'frozenset'>, <class 'generator'>, <class 'set'>)\r\n}\r\n```\r\nIn case when we use comprehension:\r\n```python\r\n{\r\n   <cyfunction <lambda> at 0x7f8f8b0775c0>: (<class 'bytes'>,),\r\n   <class 'str'>: (<class 'uuid.UUID'>,), \r\n   <cyfunction isoformat at 0x7f8f8b0774f8>: (<class 'datetime.time'>,), \r\n   <cyfunction <lambda> at 0x7f8f8b077688>: (<class 'datetime.timedelta'>,), \r\n   <class 'float'>: (<class 'decimal.Decimal'>,), \r\n   <cyfunction <lambda> at 0x7f8f8b077750>: (<enum 'Enum'>,), \r\n   <class 'list'>: (<class 'set'>,)\r\n}\r\n```"}]}
